{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2019-10-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'NEWELL BRANDS INC. AND JARDEN RECEIVABLES, LLC ENTER INTO AN AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 2, 2019, NEWELL BRANDS INC. AND JARDEN RECEIVABLES, LLC ENTERED INTO AN AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT AMONG JARDEN RECEIVABLES, AS BORROWER, THE COMPANY, AS SERVICER, THE CONDUIT LENDERS, THE COMMITTED LENDERS AND THE MANAGING AGENTS NAMED THEREIN, PNC BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION AND ROYAL BANK OF CANADA, EACH AS AN ISSUING LENDER, PNC BANK, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION, AS ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT, AND PNC CAPITAL MARKETS LLC, AS STRUCTURING AGENT (THE “AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT”). THE AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT REPLACES THE COMPANY’S EXISTING LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT THAT WOULD HAVE EXPIRED ON OCTOBER 3, 2019 AND REDUCES THE ACCOUNTS RECEIVABLE FACILITY LIMIT TO $600 MILLION ($500 MILLION DURING THE SEASONAL PERIOD, AS DEFINED IN THE AMENDED AND RESTATED LOAN AND SERVICING AGREEMENT).'}